## 2. The Service
Grocery price observations collected from retailer websites, with store, currency and
capture time on each answer. Coverage and freshness are documented at {{docs_url}} and may
change. Prices are **advertised prices on the retailer's website**, not in-store shelf
prices, and may differ from what a store charges at checkout. We are not affiliated with,
endorsed by or acting for any retailer.

