## 5. Keys, plans and limits
Send the key as `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are personal, must be kept secret and
can be revoked at any time, effective within one minute.

| Plan | Calls per minute | Calls per day (UTC) |
|---|---|---|
| free | 30 | 100 |
| pro | 120 | 50,000 |

Limits are per key and shared between the REST API and the MCP server; exceeding one
returns HTTP 429. Plans and limits may change with notice on {{site_url}}.

